{"product_id":"opal-earbuds","title":"Opal ANC Earbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eDesigned for everyday performance and all-day comfort, these wireless earbuds deliver powerful sound, reliable connectivity, and long battery life in a sleek in-ear design. Available in \u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"433\"\u003eBlack, White, Green, and Blue\u003c\/strong\u003e, they combine modern style with advanced audio technology to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"825\"\u003ePowered by an \u003cstrong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eF11 audio unit\u003c\/strong\u003e and supporting \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"606\"\u003eSBC\/AAC audio decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e, the earbuds produce clear highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for music, calls, and streaming. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, you get faster pairing, stable connections, and low power consumption for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1105\"\u003eBuilt for convenience, the earbuds feature \u003cstrong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"\u003esensitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eauto pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"950\"\u003eindependent earbud usage\u003c\/strong\u003e with master-slave switching. Whether you’re answering calls, controlling music, or activating \u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1073\"\u003eSiri or Google Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, everything is just a tap away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1333\"\u003eWith up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e40 hours of total playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"\u003elow-latency performance\u003c\/strong\u003e, these earbuds are ideal for daily use, workouts, travel, and casual gaming — offering reliable performance wherever you go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50996504690966,"sku":"23711","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50996504658198,"sku":"23707","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50996504723734,"sku":"23709","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Opal_Beige-1.webp?v=1775561678","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/opal-earbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}